  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C).",
    "Mix golden halwa with melted coconut oil and maple syrup until well combined.",
    "Add vegan brownie mix and stir until a dough forms.",
    "Press dough into a greased 8x8 inch baking dish.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool completely.",
    "Cut into squares and serve. Optional: top with chopped nuts."
